Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.91,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(389.538,0.923)}Nobita's Wedding Ceremony?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.91,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(256,532)}Brought to you by: {\fs38}Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you, Princess Snow White, whom I've been waiting for, all these years....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the prince from my dreams. I can't believe that you're right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are holding hands of each other and flirting, I can't watch it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are still in primary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he so upset, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were just rehearsing the script of Snow White...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.51,0:01:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} will...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.59,0:01:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi will beat me to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.81,0:01:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's good in sports too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} and Dekisugi-{\i1}kun{\i0} were holding each others' hands and flirting?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. He might have already proposed marriage to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How nonsensical.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, you should talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}'s worry is building up, once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't we already visit Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} of, 25 years from now, in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:36.59,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: See the story "Nobita's Wife-To-Be"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, she was my wife then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're only here so that I can have a bright future?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, but....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.27,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was unable to marry Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But, what can I do....?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:02:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are so worried... Then, why don't we visit your Wedding Ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Time Note!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}'s Wedding Ceremony is on...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what if I marry someone else...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're so unpopular with other girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,On a sunny day... 12 years from now....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding reception is being held at the Prince Melon Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, are you coming with me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The site where our house had stood then, had been now turned into a public toilet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Melon Hotel is over there!
