Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go and watch what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.83,0:02:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sure you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the Future Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But he ran in such a hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.14,0:03:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have been late, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,On what floor is the ceremony taking place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of mister whom, may I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi Nobita and Minamoto Shizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment please...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.07,0:03:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nobi Nobita and Minamoto Shizuka" he says...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to marry Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi ain't got a thing on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But you came a day earlier than the scheduled day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He got the date wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, you never grew up, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, if the ceremony is tomorrow, then why are we here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.64,0:03:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have pressed the wrong button of the Time Machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we are sure that I'm gonna marry Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're already here, let's visit the ceremony tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're living in a big mansion like this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.05,0:04:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You rose early and went in a hurry, but where did you went to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd went to view the ceremony hall...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'd went in taxi to view the ceremony hall..." he says...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not tired at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But time sure flies so fast, he was so childish always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:04:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get married tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But will Nobita be OK after marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also worried about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm your child after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents care for you like you're still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What, mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a call from Gouda Takeshi-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I had forgot. We planned to conduct rehearsal for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.88,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(398.805,341.385)}Gouda Store
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:52.51,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\pos(408.748,528.615)}Gouda Store
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant's home is still the same.,.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Our beloved idol, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.47,0:05:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make her yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.. It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just chillin' out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to maker her happy, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pulverize you, if you maker her cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will take good care of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so tearful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's midnight already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The full-moon is beautiful as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} is up to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The trio are having a farewell party, it seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}. She's as beautiful as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will wash the rest! Go to sleep now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to rise early, tomorrow, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.23,0:07:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and don't forget to say good night to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.61,0:07:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish you good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.93,0:08:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it? She's going to be married tomorrow and go away...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She just can't be honest at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use "Truth Transmitter!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, I won't marry anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you saying so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm gone, won't you become lonely, daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret that I wasn't able to do anything for you two in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really! It's been very lively for us ever since you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The memories you shared with us are like precious gifts for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.57,0:09:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as our memories last, I feel like I can handle the loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So you don't need to worry about me, Shizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:10:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be able to realize the happiness by marrying Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0} and starting a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your decision to marry Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0} was right, I'm sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He wishes for others' happiness and shares their sorrows as if it were his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that's most important thing about a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll make you happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, I will! I mean it....!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So please believe me!